Error [E0967]: source `default` is declared with two different refs
 Why: one module declares `default` as `github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-24.05`, another as `github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-23.11` — sources merge by name, so the refs must agree
 Fix: make every declaration of this source agree, or rename one of them
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0967
